    # zoe "I'm sorry. I was in a hurry, I didn't have many options, and your place felt like the obvious choice at the time."
    zoe "对不起。我当时很急，没太多选择，你家是当时最明显的选择。"

# game/scripts/Characters/zoe.rpy:1243
